WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:05.548
Everything is starting to slide sideways.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.524
What do you say we get out of here?

00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:10.694
ZOE:
&lt;i&gt;Taking a drug to bring Zach back?&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.196
This can't be the way.

00:00:12.279 --> 00:00:14.615
The last time you dosed a guest
with this mixture, he died, Masha.

00:00:14.698 --> 00:00:16.158
&lt;i&gt;I know your history.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:16.241 --> 00:00:18.035
&lt;i&gt;This isn't about&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;the Marconis finding Zach.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:20.412
&lt;i&gt;This is more about you&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;connecting with somebody else.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:20.495 --> 00:00:22.289
This is not safe!

00:00:22.372 --> 00:00:25.083
I think the wheels
are starting to fall off.

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:26.919
♪ ♪

00:00:27.002 --> 00:00:28.378
(quietly): And off we go.

